# Never upload these to Workers Static Assets. Vite copies public/ verbatim
# into build/client, so macOS and Windows folder metadata would otherwise be
# served publicly and expose the directory listing. Finder recreates .DS_Store
# on its own, so deleting it once is not enough — this file is the guard.
# Wrangler reads this from the assets root and does not upload it either.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
